# Surveillance loci on V. cholerae O1 2010EL-1786 (CP003069.1 chr1, CP003070.1 chr2).
# BED: 0-based start, end-exclusive. Curated by hand; do not regenerate by keyword.
#
# Provenance of each interval (checked 2026-09-26):
#   ann = /gene annotation in the 2010EL-1786 GenBank record
#   aln = N16961 CDS (AE003852.1/AE003853.1, locus tag given) aligned with bwa mem,
#         MAPQ 60; used where 2010EL-1786 has no /gene name
# All intervals except wbeT verified: start codon, stop codon, length % 3 == 0.
#
# Interpretation limits (mapping to an O1 reference):
#   - Calls are presence/absence of reference-like sequence only. Genes absent
#     from this reference (e.g. O139 wbf cluster) cannot be detected here.
#   - wbeT present does not give Ogawa vs Inaba (point mutations); gyrA/parC/parE
#     present does not give QRDR resistance mutations. Allele calls are future work.
#   - hapR (2026-10-07): the phenotypic_prediction.py coordinates
#     (CP003069.1:1086835-1087515) were checked and contain NO hapR-like
#     ORF -- do not use. True hapR located by homology: 612-bp CDS on the
#     minus strand (1-based 3023604-3024215), translating to a 203-aa
#     protein identical to C6706 HapR (NCBI protein QPC53839.1); annotated
#     as Vch1786_I2895 (TetR/AcrR family transcriptional regulator).
#   - vexB (2026-10-07): Vch1786_I0421 is a different RND transporter
#     (901/1036 aa differ). True vexB located by homology: 3111-bp CDS on
#     the minus strand (1-based 2584971-2588081), translating to a
#     1036-aa protein identical to C6706 VexB (NCBI protein QPC53479.1);
#     annotated as Vch1786_I2444 (conserved hypothetical protein).
#     Weng et al., PLOS Pathog 2026: VexB couples MDR with hypervirulence.
#   - hapR: not annotated as a named CDS in N16961 or 2010EL-1786, and
#     presence/absence cannot detect its known loss-of-function alleles;
#     the BED row uses homology-verified coordinates (see above) and the
#     alleles table scans the CDS for observed variants only.
#
#chrom	start	end	name	score	strand	source
